;; clj-kondo config for hive-addon.
;;
;; Macro hooks are NOT authored here. hive-dsl ships them as an exported config
;; (clj-kondo.exports/io.github.hive-agi/hive-dsl in its jar), and clj-kondo
;; imports it under .clj-kondo/imports/ from the classpath:
;;
;;   clj-kondo --lint "$(clojure -Spath)" --dependencies --parallel --copy-configs
;;
;; A hand-copied hook here would be a second definition of the same macro
;; semantics, drifting on every hive-dsl release.
{}
